diff --git a/docs/releases/4.1.txt b/docs/releases/4.1.txt
index 4cad556dc3..786064b9e0 100644
--- a/docs/releases/4.1.txt
+++ b/docs/releases/4.1.txt
@@ -437,6 +437,12 @@ backends.
 * ``BaseDatabaseFeatures.has_case_insensitive_like`` is changed from ``True``
   to ``False`` to reflect the behavior of most databases.
 
+* The ``SchemaEditor._alter_column_type_sql()`` method now requires the
+  ``old_collation`` and ``new_collation`` arguments, ``sql_alter_column_type``
+  must include a ``%(collation)s`` placeholder, and
+  ``SchemaEditor.sql_alter_column_collate`` and
+  ``SchemaEditor._alter_column_collation_sql()`` are removed.
+
 * ``DatabaseIntrospection.get_key_columns()`` is removed. Use
   ``DatabaseIntrospection.get_relations()`` instead.
 
